  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "在以工时组织的雇佣劳动中，",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4400,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "劳动者让渡的是一定期限内的劳动力使用权。",
      "startMs": 4400,
      "endMs": 9100,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "清单提前清空，约定工时不会因此自动结束。",
      "startMs": 9100,
      "endMs": 13000,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "企业仍能在约定时段分配其他任务。",
      "startMs": 13000,
      "endMs": 17600,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "工作能否真正结束，还受响应要求、",
      "startMs": 17600,
      "endMs": 21500,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "任务标准和工时界限的约束。",
      "startMs": 21500,
      "endMs": 25700,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "技术缩短了执行过程，",
      "startMs": 25700,
      "endMs": 30500,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "劳动者对劳动时间的决定权",
      "startMs": 30500,
      "endMs": 34700,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "未必同步扩大。",
      "startMs": 34700,
      "endMs": 39000,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
